# --- Gmail (email channel, optional) ---
# 1. console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → enable "Gmail API"
# 2. OAuth consent screen → External → add cyril.joseph@coco-samui-ai.com as test user
# 3. Credentials → Create credentials → OAuth client ID → Web application
#    Authorized redirect URIs:
#      http://localhost:3000/api/gmail/callback
#      https://<your-app>.vercel.app/api/gmail/callback
# 4. Put the client id/secret below, deploy, then open in Chrome:
#      <APP_BASE_URL>/api/gmail/auth?key=<DASHBOARD_PASSWORD>
#    sign in with cyril.joseph@coco-samui-ai.com → the page shows the refresh token.
# 5. Set GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN, redeploy, then verify:
#      <APP_BASE_URL>/api/gmail/status?key=<DASHBOARD_PASSWORD>
GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=
GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=
GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN=
